<metadata><name>Frog Lake Buttes</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:160-3: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.229008" lon="-121.699244"><ele>1195.6</ele><name>Frog Lake Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:frog-lake-sno-park (OSM way 39508682); confidence: high; pdf_page: 162; book_elev_ft: 3952; quote: From Frog Lake Sno-Park ski south on Road 2610</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.226649" lon="-121.695819"><ele>1199.0</ele><name>Road 2610 / Road 220 junction</name><desc>source: OSM node at the start of way 5192871 'Frog Lake Butte Road' on NF 2610, 0.23 mi from the pin; confidence: high; pdf_page: 162; quote: ski south on Road 2610 0.2 mile to the first road on the left. This is Road 220</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.217354" lon="-121.666138"><ele>1616.3</ele><name>Road 220 end (Frog Lake Butte Trailhead area)</name><desc>source: end of OSM way 5192871 Frog Lake Butte Road; confidence: high; pdf_page: 162; quote: Road 220, which you follow to the summit</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.217720" lon="-121.666770"><ele>1615.4</ele><name>South top of the summit plateau</name><desc>source: OSM peak node 357309513, DEM 5,300 ft, just past the road end; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 163; quote: so the view of Hood from the summit plateau is well deserved</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.219000" lon="-121.666000"><ele>1613.5</ele><name>Plateau ridge</name><desc>source: on the ridge crest north of the south top, DEM 5,294 ft; confidence: low; pdf_page: 163</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.220500" lon="-121.665000"><ele>1588.1</ele><name>Ridge saddle</name><desc>source: shallow saddle on the crest, DEM 5,210 ft; keeps the line on the ridge; confidence: low; pdf_page: 163</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.221500" lon="-121.664000"><ele>1604.9</ele><name>Ridge below the top</name><desc>source: ridge crest, DEM 5,265 ft; confidence: low; pdf_page: 163</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.222859" lon="-121.662555"><ele>1627.6</ele><name>Frog Lake Buttes summit</name><desc>source: OSM peak node 7143312460, DEM 5,340 ft (book 5,294); the topo's 'Frog Lake Buttes' label and the sketch's triangle sit at the north end of the plateau; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 163; book_elev_ft: 5294; quote: map 36: FROG LK BUTTES 5294'</desc></wpt>
